ommit_id":"898de66ae83716e8f72782f87af216ebdce5b24e","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Renamed it to `window_set_input_region`\r\n\r\n> personally the p_mpass flag could be removed and we could just use an empty region for resetting.\r\n\r\nNo, empty region is not resetting, it's fully transparent, so there are 3 states:\r\n- flag is set → use empty region, window pass all input.\r\n- flag is not set and region is not empty → use non-empty region, parts of window pass input.\r\n- flag is not set and region is empty → use `nullptr` region, window is fully opaque.","created_at":"2026-10-05T07:56:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T07:56:56Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123907#discussion_r4181805150","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123907","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4181805150"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123907#discussion_r4181805150"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123907"}},"reactions":{"url":"https